[{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0525","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0525.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1058","title":"Cobalt Qube 3.0 目录遍历认证绕过漏洞","description":"Cobalt Qube 3.0 的 splashAdmin.php 存在目录遍历漏洞，本地用户或远程攻击者可通过在 sessionId Cookie 中注入 \"..\"（点点）序列指向备用会话文件，从而绕过身份认证机制，获取 Qube 管理员权限。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重，攻击者无需身份验证即可远程利用，完全控制目标系统。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1058"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-10-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:38Z","remediation":"立即升级 Cobalt Qube 3.0 至厂商发布的安全更新版本，该补丁通过 ISS X-Force 渠道发布（参考 BID 5297）。如无法升级，在 Web 服务器（Apache）层面配置访问控制，限制对 /splashAdmin.php 的访问来源 IP，仅允许受信任管理 IP 段访问；同时在反向代理或防火墙上添加规则，过滤 sessionId cookie 中的 `../` 目录遍历序列。由于 Cobalt Qube 产品已停止维护，建议迁移至受支持的服务器平台。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-07/0261.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9669.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5297","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21640","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a0edea60322bafbed67887cf7a4d97a55df8a9fa/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1058.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1058.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1058","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1058.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1058.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-10xx/CVE-2002-1058.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/debb5b9043b725433d6b6e41048f63a9bcce2f7e/2002/CVE-2002-1058.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c45038e15e6e81771cce5512f28070ebf02ca969/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1058.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1058.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1058.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0525.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0525.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0525.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0524","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0524.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1057","title":"SmartMax MailMax Popmax 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"SmartMax MailMax 4.8 的 POP3 服务组件（popmax）存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向该服务发送超长的 USER 命令参数触发缓冲区溢出，导致任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 SmartMax MailMax 4.8 版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。目前已存在公开的利用代码，建议用户立即升级至不受影响的版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1057"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-10-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:38Z","remediation":"SmartMax MailMax 已停止维护且厂商已不存在，无法通过补丁修复。建议立即将 MailMax 升级或迁移至其他仍在维护的邮件服务器软件（如 hMailServer、MailEnable 等）。如无法立即迁移，可在防火墙层面将 POP3 端口（110/TCP）的访问权限限制为仅允许受信任的内部 IP，禁止来自外网的任何连接，以降低远程利用风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-07/0245.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9651.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5285","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21633","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a0edea60322bafbed67887cf7a4d97a55df8a9fa/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1057.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1057.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1057","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1057.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1057.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-10xx/CVE-2002-1057.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/debb5b9043b725433d6b6e41048f63a9bcce2f7e/2002/CVE-2002-1057.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c45038e15e6e81771cce5512f28070ebf02ca969/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1057.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1057.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1057.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0524.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0523","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0523.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1048","title":"HP JetDirect 打印机 SNMP JetAdmin 设备密码泄漏漏洞","description":"HP JetDirect 打印机存在 SNMP JetAdmin 设备密码泄露漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向目标设备发送特制的 SNMP 请求，访问 OID 变量 .iso.3.6.1.4.1.11.2.3.9.4.2.1.3.9.1.1.0，从而获取 Web 和 Telnet 服务的管理员密码。该漏洞影响多款 HP JetDirect 打印机型号，攻击者获取密码后可完全控制设备，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。目前已有公开的 ExploitDB 利用代码。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1048"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-10-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:37Z","remediation":"立即将 HP JetDirect 打印机固件升级到 X.22.09 或更高版本，该版本已修复 SNMP 变量泄露管理密码的问题。如无法立即升级，可在网络边界防火墙或交换机 ACL 中限制对打印机 UDP 161/162 端口的 SNMP 访问，仅允许受信任的管理主机连接，并禁用打印机上不必要的 Web 和 Telnet 管理服务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-07/0345.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9693.php","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/377003","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5331","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/22319","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a0edea60322bafbed67887cf7a4d9