措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-07/0117.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9547.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5212","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21612","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a0edea60322bafbed67887cf7a4d97a55df8a9fa/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1043.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1043.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1043","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1043.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1043.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-10xx/CVE-2002-1043.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/08861b52e373e5d8411b1b6670fe650ef2757f4b/2002/CVE-2002-1043.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c45038e15e6e81771cce5512f28070ebf02ca969/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1043.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1043.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1043.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0522.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0521","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0521.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1042","title":"Sun Microsystems iPlanet Web Server 目录遍历任意文件读取漏洞","description":"iPlanet Web Server 6.0 SP2、4.1 SP9 及 Netscape Enterprise Server 3.6 在 Windows 平台上的搜索引擎组件存在目录遍历漏洞。攻击者无需身份认证，向搜索组件发送包含 ..\\（点-反斜杠）序列的 NS-query-pat 参数请求，即可利用该漏洞绕过服务器目录访问限制，遍历读取服务器操作系统上的任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露。攻击条件为可远程访问目标服务器的搜索接口，且目标运行于 Windows 平台。该漏洞已存在公开利用方法，攻击者可据此读取配置文件、口令文件等敏感数据，危害较为严重。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1042"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-10-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:37Z","remediation":"该漏洞存在于已停止支持的旧版 iPlanet/Netscape 服务器中，官方已不再发布补丁。建议立即迁移至受支持的 Web 服务器（如 Oracle iPlanet Web Server 7.0+ 或替代产品），并在迁移前通过 WAF 规则拦截包含 `..\\` 及 `NS-query-pat` 参数的请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-07/0085.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9517.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5191","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21603","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a0edea60322bafbed67887cf7a4d97a55df8a9fa/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1042.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1042","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1042.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1042.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c45038e15e6e81771cce5512f28070ebf02ca969/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1042.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1042.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/08861b52e373e5d8411b1b6670fe650ef2757f4b/2002/CVE-2002-1042.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1042.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1042.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-10xx/CVE-2002-1042.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":fals