alse,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0515.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0514","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0514.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1023","title":"Working Resources BadBlue HTTP GET 请求拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Working Resources BadBlue 1.7.3 Enterprise/Personal 版本存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需认证即可向目标服务器发送一个不带 URI 的 HTTP GET 请求，触发服务器崩溃导致拒绝服务。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需特殊权限即可利用，影响 BadBlue 1.7.3 系列版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1023"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-10-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:35Z","remediation":"建议立即将 BadBlue 升级至 2.0 或更高版本（1.7.3 及更早版本均受影响）。若厂商已停止支持无法升级，应迁移至其他受支持的 Web 服务器（如 Apache HTTP Server、Nginx）。临时缓解措施：在反向代理或 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）层面拦截不含 URI 路径的畸形 GET 请求（如匹配 \"GET HTTP/1\" 的请求行），并在网络层面限制对 BadBlue 服务端口的访问来源。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-07/0082.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-07/0143.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9528.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5187","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21600","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c6e3b04088d3a34fb448e0c7ffd377395dcc3ef8/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1023.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6e8a79e44f6fbd3ac137885a8646f81e8e0c401a/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1023.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1023","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1023.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1023.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7f050e8fca5626f412366605b1f58958789b2919/2002/CVE-2002-1023.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/9af727c40ac027294e4558abbc02d8967ee2a1d7/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-10xx/CVE-2002-1023.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ca31171c444e5a175f3ac1833b0261c6587a34e9/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1023.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1023.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1023.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0514.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0513","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0513.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1021","title":"Working Resources BadBlue 空字节文件泄漏漏洞","description":"BadBlue 1.7.3 版本存在空字节文件泄漏漏洞，其原理是服务器在处理 HTTP 请求时未正确过滤十六进制编码的空字节（%00），导致攻击者可绕过文件扩展名检查读取受限文件（如 EXT.INI 配置文件）。该漏洞影响 Working Resources BadBlue 1.7.3 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0（中等危害），攻击向量为网络远程、低复杂度、无需认证。攻击者仅需发送包含 %00 的特制 HTTP 请求即可利用，例如请求 ext.ini%00.txt 来读取敏感配置信息，造成信息泄露风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1021"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-10-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:34Z","remediation":"The user wants me to generate a remediation field for CVE-2002-1021. This is a vulnerability in BadBlue server 1.7.3 that allows reading restricted files via a hex-encoded null byte. I need to provide actionable Chinese remediation steps ≥20 characters.\n\nBased on the presearch data:\n- BadBlue 1.7.3 is affected\n- The vulnerability is a null byte file disclosure\n- No specific patch version is mentioned in the data\n- The product is from 2002, likely discontinued\n\nI need to write specific, actionable remediation steps in Chinese.<value>立即将 BadBlue 服务器升级至 1.7.3 以上版本（如官方已停止维护，建议迁移至其他受支持的 Web 服务器如 Apache 或 Nginx）。若无法升级，可在反向代理或 WAF 层拦截包含 `%00`（URL 编码空字节）的 HTTP 请求，并严格限制对 EXT.INI 等敏感文件的直接访问。同时配置 Web 服务器对 URL 中的空字节字符进行过滤或拒绝，防止路径遍历绕过。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-07/0143.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9557.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5226","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21616","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c6e3b04088d3a34fb448e0c7ffd377395dcc3ef8/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1021.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6e8a79e44f6fbd3ac137885a8646f81e8e0c401a/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1021.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1021","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1021.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1021.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/5606c11566e9461a0d44f0944086969cb6810ef1/2002/CVE-2002-1021.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/9af727c40ac027294e4558abbc02d8967ee2a1d7/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-10xx/CVE-2002-1021.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ca31171c444e5a175f3ac1833b0261c6587a34e9/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1021.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1021.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1021.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0513.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0512","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0512.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1016","title":"Adobe eBook Reader 文件恢复权限提升漏洞","description":"Adobe eBook Reader 2.2 存在文件恢复权限提升漏洞。本地攻击者可通过备份关键数据文件，执行复制、打印、借阅和赠送等受限操作，再恢复原始数据文件，从而绕过数字版权管理（DRM）限制。该漏洞影响 Adobe eBook Reader 2.2 版本，攻击者需具备本地系统访问权限，利用方式简单，可导致未授权的文件操作和权限提升。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1016"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-10-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:34Z","remediation":"卸载 Adobe eBook Reader 2.2，升级至 Adobe Digital Editions 4.5 或更高版本以替代旧版；如无法升级，通过操作系统 ACL 限制对 `%APPDATA%\\Adobe\\eBook Reader` 目录的写入权限，仅允许 Administrators 组完全控制，禁止普通用户修改数据文件；同时启用文件审计日志监控对该目录的异常备份/恢复操作。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.grok.org.uk/pipermail/full-disclosure/2002-July/000177.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9634.php","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/438867","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5273","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21629","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c6e3b04088d3a34fb448e0c7ffd377395dcc3ef8/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1016.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6e8a79e44f6fbd3ac137885a8646f81e8e0c401a/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1016.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1016","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1016.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1016.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3355d48a7d0ca0d3b4124274995f7205f0bb89f2/2002/CVE-2002-1016.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/9af727c40ac027294e4558abbc02d8967ee2a1d7/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-10xx/CVE-2002-1016.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ca31171c444e5a175f3ac1833b0261c6587a34e9/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1016.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1016.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1016.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0512.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0511","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0511.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1014","title":"Real Networks RealJukebox 和 RealOne Player 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"RealJukebox 2（1.0.2.340 及 1.0.2.379 版本）与 RealOne Player Gold（6.0.10.505 版本）在处理 RFS 皮肤文件时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。由于 skin.ini 配置文件中的 CONTROLnImage 参数未对输入长度进行有效边界检查，远程攻击者可构造包含超长值的恶意皮肤文件，通过网页或 HTML 邮件等方式诱使用户打开，触发栈缓冲区溢出，覆盖返回地址并劫持程序执行流程，最终在用户权限下执行任意代码。CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1014"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-10-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:34Z","remediation":"立即卸载 RealJukebox 2（1.0.2.340/1.0.2.379）及 RealOne Player Gold（6.0.10.505），这些产品已停止技术支持多年，不存在官方补丁。作为替代方案，升级到 RealNetworks 后续安全版本（如 RealPlayer SP 或更高版本），并在浏览器中禁用 RealPlayer 插件，同时配置防火墙阻止对外发起异常连接。若业务必须使用，建议在隔离沙箱环境中运行，且不要打开来源不明的 .rfs 皮肤文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-07/0127.html","http://service.real.com/help/faq/security/bufferoverrun07092002.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9538.php","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/843667","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5217","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21615","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a31aa101497b2d23391e84ef31f75e6600381dae/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1014.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1014","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6e8a79e44f6fbd3ac137885a8646f81e8e0c401a/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1014.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1014.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1014.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3355d48a7d0ca0d3b4124274995f7205f0bb89f2/2002/CVE-2002-1014.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ca31171c444e5a175f3ac1833b0261c6587a34e9/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1014.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/9af727c40ac027294e4558abbc02d8967ee2a1d7/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-10xx/CVE-2002-1014.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1014.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/2ea9851780633b2caab16fe048a14b38ca9a0b56/content/CVE-2002-1014.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0511.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0510","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0510.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1013","title":"Inktomi Traffic Server traffic_manager 路径参数缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Inktomi Traffic Server 的 traffic_manager 组件存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。当本地用户向 traffic_manager 传递超长的 -path 参数时，会触发缓冲区溢出，攻击者可借此获取目标系统的 root 权限。该漏洞影响 Inktomi Traffic Server 4.0.18 至 5.2.2 版本、Traffic Edge 1.1.2 和 1.5.0 版本以及 Media-IXT 3.0.4 版本。由于漏洞利用仅需本地用户权限、攻击复杂度低且无需身份认证，成功利用后可完全控制受影响系统，危害等级为高危，CVSS 评分为 7.2。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1013"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-10-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:33Z","remediation":"升级至 Inktomi 官方补丁版本（参见 SecurityFocus BID 5098 及 Inktomi KB 070202-003），该漏洞在后续版本中已修复。由于 Inktomi Traffic Server 已停止维护，建议迁移至其继任者 Apache Traffic Server（当前最新稳定版）。作为临时缓解措施，限制本地用户对 traffic_manager 二进制文件的执行权限，仅允许受信任的管理员账户运行，并通过系统审计日志监控 traffic_manager 的异常参数调用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-07/0023.html","http://support.inktomi.com/kb/070202-003.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9465.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5098","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21580","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a31aa101497b2d23391e84ef31f75e6600381dae/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1013.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1013","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be7c9eef0523e112dce5fde0006bf85d14a40618/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1013.